" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Charged_Gauntlets.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Charged_Gauntlets.png/420px-Legendary_Charged_Gauntlets.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"706\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Charged_Gauntlets.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Nebula_Fragment_Crafting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nebula Fragment Crafting\">Nebula Fragment Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Perfected_Charged_Gauntlets\" title=\"Item:Perfected Charged Gauntlets\">Perfected Charged Gauntlets</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>These gloves channel powerful electric energy into enemies that you strike.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817213704\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.124 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.192 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4676/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38712/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13609/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 byt